        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>SD_STAT Register Field Descriptions</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #080808;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1260px;\n    min-height: 1980px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-top: 31px;\n  }\n  .logo {\n    height: 105px;\n    width: 275px;\n    position: relative;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #252122;\n    line-height: .82;\n    padding: 8px 0 0 65px;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    letter-spacing: -1.4px;\n  }\n  .logo:before {\n    content: \"ti\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 6px;\n    top: 0;\n    font-family: Arial Black, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 52px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: -12px;\n    transform: scaleX(.72);\n  }\n  .logo:after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 22px;\n    top: 41px;\n    width: 19px;\n    height: 28px;\n    background: #252122;\n    border-radius: 0 0 11px 11px;\n    transform: rotate(-23deg);\n  }\n  .logo .texas { display: block; }\n  .logo .instruments { display: block; margin-left: 4px; }\n\n  .topline {\n    margin-top: 9px;\n    height: 31px;\n    border-bottom: 4px solid #111;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    font-size: 21px;\n  }\n  .topline .right { font-style: italic; margin-top: -2px; }\n\n  h1 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    margin: 28px 0 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  table {\n    width: 1260px;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 1.12;\n  }\n  th, td {\n    border: 1px solid #111;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n  }\n  th {\n    height: 34px;\n    background: #d8d8d8;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-top: 2px;\n  }\n  th.bit { text-align: center; }\n  td.bit {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n  }\n  td.field, td.type, td.reset { padding-top: 4px; }\n  col.bit { width: 125px; }\n  col.field { width: 252px; }\n  col.type { width: 125px; }\n  col.reset { width: 125px; }\n  col.desc { width: 633px; }\n\n  tr.r8 { height: 449px; }\n  tr.r7 { height: 234px; }\n  tr.r6 { height: 235px; }\n  tr.r5 { height: 370px; }\n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    bottom: 43px;\n    width: 1260px;\n    height: 70px;\n    border-top: 4px solid #111;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .footer .line1 {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n  }\n  .footer .doc { flex: 1; }\n  .footer .mmc { font-style: italic; margin-right: 30px; }\n  .footer .page-no { width: 46px; text-align: right; }\n  .feedback {\n    color: #0000ee;\n    font-style: italic;\n    margin-top: 1px;\n  }\n  .copyright {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 100%;\n    text-align: center;\n    bottom: -25px;\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"logo\" aria-label=\"Texas Instruments\">\n    <span class=\"texas\">TEXAS</span>\n    <span class=\"instruments\">INSTRUMENTS</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"topline\">\n    <div>www.ti.com</div>\n    <div class=\"right\">Multimedia Card Registers</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1>Table 18-38. SD_STAT Register Field Descriptions (continued)</h1>\n\n  <table>\n    <colgroup>\n      <col class=\"bit\">\n      <col class=\"field\">\n      <col class=\"type\">\n      <col class=\"reset\">\n      <col class=\"desc\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th class=\"bit\">Bit</th>\n        <th>Field</th>\n        <th>Type</th>\n        <th>Reset</th>\n        <th>Description</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr class=\"r8\">\n        <td class=\"bit\">8</td>\n        <td class=\"field\">CIRQ</td>\n        <td class=\"type\">R</td>\n        <td class=\"reset\">0h</td>\n        <td>\n          Card interrupt.<br>\n          This bit is only used for SD and SDIO cards.<br>\n          In<br>\n          1-bit mode, interrupt source is asynchronous (can be a source of<br>\n          asynchronous wake-up).<br>\n          In<br>\n          4-bit mode, interrupt source is sampled during the interrupt cycle.<br>\n          In CE-ATA mode, interrupt source is detected when the card drives<br>\n          mmc_cmd line to zero during one cycle after data transmission end.<br>\n          All modes above are fully exclusive.<br>\n          The controller interrupt must be clear by setting SD_IE[8]<br>\n          CIRQ_ENABLE to 0, then the host driver must start the interrupt<br>\n          service with card (clearing card interrupt status) to remove card<br>\n          interrupt source.<br>\n          Otherwise the Controller interrupt will be reasserted as soon as<br>\n          SD_IE[8] CIRQ_ENABLE is set to 1.<br>\n          Writes to this bit are ignored.<br><br>\n          0h (R) = No card interrupt<br><br>\n          1h (R) = Generate card interrupt\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r7\">\n        <td class=\"bit\">7</td>\n        <td class=\"field\">CREM</td>\n        <td class=\"type\">R/W</td>\n        <td class=\"reset\">0h</td>\n        <td>\n          Card Removal.<br>\n          This bit is set automatically when SD_PSTATE[CINS] changes from<br>\n          1 to 0.<br>\n          A clear of this bit doesn't affect Card inserted present state<br>\n          (SD_PSTATE[CINS]).<br>\n          0h (W) = Status bit unchanged<br>\n          0h (R) = Card State stable or debouncing<br>\n          1h (W) = Status is cleared<br>\n          1h (R) = Card Removed\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r6\">\n        <td class=\"bit\">6</td>\n        <td class=\"field\">CINS</td>\n        <td class=\"type\">R/W</td>\n        <td class=\"reset\">0h</td>\n        <td>\n          Card Insertion.<br>\n          This bit is set automatically when SD_PSTATE[CINS] changes from<br>\n          0 to 1.<br>\n          A clear of this bit doesn't affect Card inserted present state<br>\n          (SD_PSTATE[CINS]).<br>\n          0h (W) = Status bit unchanged<br>\n          0h (R) = Card State stable or debouncing<br>\n          1h (W) = Status is cleared.<br>\n          1h (R) = Card inserted\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"r5\">\n        <td class=\"bit\">5</td>\n        <td class=\"field\">BRR</td>\n        <td class=\"type\">R/W</td>\n        <td class=\"reset\">0h</td>\n        <td>\n          Buffer read ready<br>\n          This bit is set automatically during a read operation to the card (see<br>\n          class<br>\n          2 - block oriented read commands) when one block specified by the<br>\n          SD_BLK<br>\n          [10:0] BLEN bit field is completely written in the buffer.<br>\n          It indicates that the memory card has filled out the buffer and that the<br>\n          local host needs to empty the buffer by reading it.<br>\n          Note: If the DMA receive-mode is enabled, this bit is never set<br>\n          instead a DMA receive request to the main DMA controller of the<br>\n          system is generated.<br>\n          0h (W) = Status bit unchanged<br>\n          0h (R) = Not ready to read buffer<br>\n          1h (W) = Status is cleared.<br>\n          1h (R) = Ready to read buffer\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"line1\">\n      <div class=\"doc\">SPRUH73Q–October 2011–Revised December 2019</div>\n      <div class=\"mmc\">Multimedia Card (MMC)</div>\n      <div class=\"page-no\">4299</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"feedback\">Submit Documentation Feedback</div>\n    <div class=\"copyright\">Copyright © 2011–2019, Texas Instruments Incorporated</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
